   G("Archon of Chayula", ["Prolonged Duration II", "Chaos Attunement", "Vorana's Siege", "Execute II", "Close Combat II"], L("Buff + tornados = gatilho do Molten Shower", "Buff + tornadoes = Molten Shower trigger"), L("Ativa com 100 de Glory. Os tornados não existem para detonar veneno (não há mais veneno na build): eles rolam a chance de trigger da Brutus' Lead Sprinkler a cada acerto.", "Activates at 100 Glory. The tornadoes don't exist to detonate poison (there's no more poison in the build): they roll Brutus' Lead Sprinkler's trigger chance on every hit."), "free"),
